        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-30T20:12:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have played the version that Spiff has on his site and it's good, but I now think that it doesn't help him flip more often. I agree with you that making him flip more often is the way to fix him, but I'm not sure I like your idea. He will flip turn 4 unless you kill a relic by then. However, if you do then he is going to have a hard time getting it back. I know he has Vast Following, but there is only 2 or 3 of them and he has to be lucky enough for the relic to be one of the H cards and even then you have a round to kill another one.</p>",
