        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-30T20:21:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here's the idea I have:</p><p>At the start of the game put all his zombies in the trash. Then search his deck for one copy of each of the three cultist types and put those in play. Shuffle his deck.</p><p>Gloomweaver flips at the END of his turn if he has 3 relics in play.</p><p>The big change is this: Gloomweaver's Ophidia, the Deceiver now has 25Hp and has the keyword Relic.</p><p>The heroes still win if there are 3 relics in the villain trash.</p>",
